{"id":71846,"date":"2026-10-30T09:21:29","date_gmt":"2026-10-30T09:21:29","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=71846"},"modified":"2026-10-30T10:23:04","modified_gmt":"2026-10-30T09:23:04","slug":"trilhos-cdp","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trilhos-cdp\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail e 3\u00aa Caminhada Colorida dos Trilhos CDP 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail e 3\u00aa Caminhada Colorida dos Trilhos CDP 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail e 3\u00aa Caminhada Colorida dos Trilhos CDP 2027<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>19 de setembro de 2027<\/strong> (domingo), na localidade da <strong>Pedrulha<\/strong>, na <strong>Uni\u00e3o das Freguesias de Eiras e S\u00e3o Paulo de Frades<\/strong>, concelho e distrito de <strong>Coimbra<\/strong>. O evento afirma-se no calend\u00e1rio desportivo de final de ver\u00e3o da regi\u00e3o centro sob o lema de natureza, desporto e conv\u00edvio comunit\u00e1rio.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Situada na zona norte da cidade do <strong>rio Mondego<\/strong>, entre a malha periurbana da Pedrulha e as colinas florestais de Eiras e S\u00e3o Paulo de Frades, a prova disponibiliza dois percursos oficiais confirmados no cartaz da edi\u00e7\u00e3o de 2027: uma prova de <strong>Trail de 14 km<\/strong> vocacionada para os amantes de corrida em natureza e a <strong>3\u00aa Caminhada Colorida de 7 km<\/strong> de cariz l\u00fadico e familiar.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo da sec\u00e7\u00e3o <strong>Trilhos CDP<\/strong> (Clube Desportivo da Pedrulha), com inscri\u00e7\u00f5es online abertas at\u00e9 ao dia 12 de setembro de 2027. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data